function setWorkflowStep(value){const e=current();if(!e)return;const step=Number(value);if(![1,2,3].includes(step))return;if(editorMode!=='klassisch'&&route==='paper'){editorOverlay=step===1?'themes':step===3?'finish':null;render();return;}const issue=step===2&&e.status!=='used'?L.themeSelectionIssue(e):null;if(issue){toast(issue);e.workflowStep=1;render();return;}if(e.status==='used')usedWorkflowSteps.set(e.id,step);else if(e.workflowStep!==step){e.workflowStep=step;changed();}paperQuery=paperCategory=paperTag='';if(step===2)paperCategory=workflowChoices(e).find(c=>selectedThemes(e).includes(c.id))?.id||'';render();}
function wireWorkflow(){for(const el of $$('[data-workflow-theme]'))el.addEventListener('change',()=>{const e=editableExam(),id=el.value,selected=new Set(selectedThemes(e)),limit=L.examRequirements(e)?.themeCount;if(limit&&el.checked&&!selected.has(id)&&selected.size>=limit){el.checked=false;toast('Genau drei Generalthemen: Wähle zuerst ein anderes Thema ab.');return;}if(limit&&!el.checked&&e.items.some(i=>L.patternClassify(i.task,e.pattern,L.examContext(e)).ids.includes(id))){el.checked=true;toast('Zu diesem Thema ist bereits eine Aufgabe im Blatt. Entferne oder ersetze sie zuerst.');return;}if(el.checked)selected.add(id);else selected.delete(id);if(limit){delete e.selectedCategoryIds;const choices=workflowChoices(e),preserved=(e.pattern?.slots||[]).filter(slot=>!choices.some(c=>c.id===slot.categoryId));e.pattern.slots=[...choices.filter(c=>selected.has(c.id)).map(c=>({categoryId:c.id,count:1})),...preserved];}else e.selectedCategoryIds=[...selected];e.updatedAt=C.now();changed();render();});}
